/*
========================================================
LOG ANALYSIS : DISPATCHER INHERITANCE & OVERRIDE
========================================================

LOG:
CASE 1 | Parent launch(IO) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-1
CASE 1 | Child async(INHERIT IO) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-7

ANALYSIS:
- Parent uses Dispatchers.IO
- Child async does NOT specify dispatcher
✅ Child INHERITS parent's dispatcher (IO)
- Thread name differs because IO uses a thread POOL
- Dispatcher SAME, thread MAY differ

-----------------------------------------------

LOG:
CASE 2 | Parent launch(IO) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-4
CASE 2 | Child async(OVERRIDE Default) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-6

ANALYSIS:
- Parent uses Dispatchers.IO
- Child explicitly uses Dispatchers.Default
✅ OVERRIDE happens
- Child runs on Default dispatcher pool
- No inheritance from parent

-----------------------------------------------

LOG:
CASE 3 | Parent launch(IO) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-2
CASE 3 | Child async(OVERRIDE Default) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-8
CASE 3 | GrandChild launch(INHERIT Default) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-5

ANALYSIS:
- Parent = IO
- Child overrides to Default
- GrandChild does NOT specify dispatcher
✅ GrandChild inherits Child's dispatcher (Default)
- Inheritance flows DOWN the coroutine tree

-----------------------------------------------

LOG:
CASE 4 | Parent launch(IO) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-3
CASE 4 | Child launch(OVERRIDE Default) -> DefaultDispatcher-worker-5
CASE 4 | GrandChild async(OVERRIDE Main) -> main

ANALYSIS:
- Parent = IO
- Child overrides to Default
- GrandChild explicitly overrides to Main
✅ Override can happen MULTIPLE TIMES
- Main dispatcher runs on UI thread ONLY

-----------------------------------------------

IMPORTANT OBSERVATIONS:
-----------------------
1. Dispatcher inheritance is hierarchical
2. Explicit dispatcher ALWAYS wins
3. Thread name can change even if dispatcher is same
4. Dispatcher decides THREAD POOL, not exact thread
5. main dispatcher ALWAYS maps to UI thread

========================================================
END OF LOG ANALYSIS
========================================================
*/
